graph TB
    subgraph Frontend
        CCD[CollectionCardDetail]
        CCD -->|POST /canonize| API
        CCD -->|handleCanonize| SM{Success?}
        SM -->|data + no errors| GreenMsg[Success: green]
        SM -->|data + errors| AmberMsg[Warning: amber]
        SM -->|no data / catch| RedMsg[Error: red + refetch]
    end

    subgraph Backend
        API[canonize endpoint]
        API --> Step1[Create canonical card]
        API --> Step2[Link collection entry]
        API --> Step3[MYP search + fetch]
        Step3 -->|except Exception| Warn[Log warning, set myp_warning]
        Step3 -->|success| OK[No warning]
        Warn --> Resp[Return data + ErrorDetail warning]
        OK --> Resp
    end
